                                                "sense_id": "e2391181-06f8-3e81-baac-9a5fa9c5032d",
                                                "text": "I come home, in the mornin' light / My mother says \"when you gonna live your life right\" / Oh momma, dear, we're not the fortunate ones / And girls, they wanna have fun / Oh, girls just wanna have fun"
                                            }
